"when the order of the items is not important.\n"
"\n"
"Here is one example of a itemizedlist:\n"
"\n"
"<itemizedlist>\n"
"\n"
"<listitem><para>\n"
"First item.\n"
"</para></listitem>\n"
"\n"
"<listitem><para>\n"
"Second item.\n"
"</para></listitem>\n"
"\n"
"</itemizedlist>"
msgstr ""

